---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalNotice from '../components/LegalNotice.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Social Magent content is educational. It is not career, legal or financial advice, and it does not guarantee any outcome."
  crumbs={[
    { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { label: 'Disclaimer' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        What our content is — and is not. Please read this before relying on
        anything you find here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container legal-page">
    <LegalNotice />
    {/* TODO: Have this disclaimer reviewed by a qualified Indian legal professional. */}

    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {site.legal.lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>1. Educational content only</h2>
      <p>
        Articles, guides, checklists, worksheets, newsletter emails and other
        resources on {site.name} are provided for general educational and
        informational purposes. They are not professional advice for your
        specific situation.
      </p>

      <h2>2. No career, legal or financial guarantees</h2>
      <p>
        We do not guarantee interviews, job offers, placements, promotions,
        salary increases, income, business results or any other outcome. We do
        not promise that following a resource will lead to a particular result.
        Career decisions are yours, and hiring decisions are made by employers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site is legal, financial, tax or investment advice. For
        advice about your circumstances, speak to a qualified professional.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Recruitment and hiring</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting a talent network form or a hiring brief does not create a
        guarantee of an introduction, interview or placement. We may not be able
        to help with every role or candidate. Employers make their own decisions,
        and we cannot control their process or timing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Candidates are never charged a fee. Employers may pay a success fee,
        agreed in writing before work begins.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Accuracy and currency</h2>
      <p>
        We try to keep content accurate and useful, but marketing platforms,
        laws, tools and job markets change. Information may become outdated, and
        examples may be simplified. We do not warrant that every page is
        complete, current or free from error. If you spot a mistake, please tell
        us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>5. External links and third-party tools</h2>
      <p>
        Links to external websites, tools or resources are provided for
        convenience. We do not control them and are not responsible for their
        content, accuracy, availability or practices. Mentioning a tool does not
        mean we endorse it or have a commercial relationship with it.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Affiliate and advertising disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some future resources may include affiliate links, sponsored placements
        or advertising. If that happens, we will label the commercial
        relationship near the link. We do not accept payment for positive
        reviews or unverifiable claims. At launch, this site does not contain
        affiliate links or advertising. See the
        <a href="/about/#disclosure-heading">affiliate and advertising disclosure</a>
        on the about page.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Testimonials and statistics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not publish invented testimonials, client logos or
        performance statistics. If we publish a case study or a testimonial in
        future, it will be real, used with permission and clearly labelled.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, {site.name} and its operator are not
        liable for any loss arising from reliance on the content of this site.
        You use the resources and information at your own discretion.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
